===Etymology===
{{m|en|sharp}} + {{m|en|shooter}}: a [[calque]] translation of {{der|en|de|Scharfschütze}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A person trained to shoot [[precisely]] with a [[rifle]]; a [[marksman]].
#: {{cot|en|rifleman|sniper}}
# A [[proconiine]].

